Track 3: 0.04-Micro-Syllable Inquiry
- Story & Context: Long after the facility was permanently sealed, a scavenger wanders the ruins and asks the wall if the accelerator’s hum was actually the voice of a trapped god or just a cooling motor. She finds a piece of broken string embedded in the concrete floor, still vibrating with a metallic hum that hums like an unanswered prayer. "If you found the sequence, would you turn the heavy lock?"
